{"title":"2010 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 10","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem_10\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 10</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_10\">Problem 10</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 10\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Marvin had a birthday on Tuesday, May 27 in the leap year <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/c/abc1744a459ad135efd3fd45fca7285cae133717.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2008$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" />. In what year will his birthday next fall on a Saturday?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/6/dc67f14d7470ff05c6cf4c69afc9fd0be11d8cf6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)}\\ 2011 \\qquad \\mathrm{(B)}\\ 2012 \\qquad \\mathrm{(C)}\\ 2013 \\qquad \\mathrm{(D)}\\ 2015 \\qquad \\mathrm{(E)}\\ 2017$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"478\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>There are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/8/988ab73be88b10c8cbf520db5e7cb4b3c6531963.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$365$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" /> days in a non-leap year. There are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> days in a week. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/1/49158a298bb0ec42da3eacf331e2acf4df98f52a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$365 = 52 \\cdot 7 + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"122\" height=\"14\" /> (or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/a/6daba05d8944282f2d9362a4e513d07dcbcadecb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$365\\equiv 1 \\pmod{ 7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"131\" height=\"18\" />), the same date (after February) moves \"forward\" one day in the subsequent year, if that year is not a leap year.\n</p><p>For example:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/8/c582adc968af49a28a24b376decf5f28d4e0db16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5/27/08$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" />\tTue\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/b/f1b5789b63907e1221f45e6a4b135e8d4f689b36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5/27/09$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" />\tWed\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/5/ee54fccae5f487ace823bfe25bf2d0363d6528bb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5/27/10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" />\tThur\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/0/e503fd6ad74a6ccbe44ce9ece4b284a121dc383b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5/27/11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" />\tFri\n</p><p>However, 2012 is a leap year and has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/c/72c7f26c7f5056ac93c5472b3e66e25efec0160c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$366$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" /> days, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/6/b1605d8b522fd83873148342f972e62ea50f2ee8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$366 = 52 \\cdot 7 + 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"122\" height=\"14\" /> . This means we move \"forward\" <b>two</b> days in 2012, and skip past Saturday and straight to Sunday.\n</p><p>Therefore:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/0/e503fd6ad74a6ccbe44ce9ece4b284a121dc383b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5/27/11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" />\tFri\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/8/b680087685c89c0f6abd30349470e7ec52d32be7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5/27/12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" />\tSun\n</p><p>You can keep counting forward to find that the first time this date falls on a Saturday is in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/1/5617f6d8def6056c5921630439d64b56cfa519ab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2017$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"36\" height=\"13\" />:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/d/4bd427f1c69bc02c5abb2b3be2ddb479ae9cbc51.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5/27/13$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" />\tMon\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/f/d4fbd89de32f83f30fb59f895f335ddf20943c4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5/27/14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"63\" height=\"18\" />\tTue\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/4/634b372e09b79959984e90528e0e91bb2bd8ade8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5/27/15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" />\tWed\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/5/21500815c9bac1b63e4e8827dbce014854b1beb9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5/27/16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" />\tFri\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/1/971969d9d394d7b2ea545e37f3154ed2f023451f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5/27/17$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"63\" height=\"18\" />\tSat\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/b/27b3ff2dbc9b25c2a115e74c15329ffaa0ace050.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{(E) 2017}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"78\" height=\"32\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/P7rGLXp_6es?t=628\">https://youtu.be/P7rGLXp_6es?t=628</a>\n</p><p>~IceMatrix\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_10A\" title=\"2010 AMC 10A\">2010 AMC 10A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_10A_Problems\" title=\"2010 AMC 10A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?titl